    fact: '“Sexsomnia” is a type of sleep behavior that occurs when someone engages in any sexual activity, from fondling to intercourse, while asleep. For example, one man masturbated in his sleep so vigorously that he suffered “repeated bruising of the penis.” Sufferers of sexsomnia typically have no conscious awareness of what they’re doing',
    category: 'Human',
