    fact: "Intending to combat our planet's plastic problem, Mexican company BioFase uses avocado seeds to make biodegradable plastic cutlery. These can be stored in a dry place just like ordinary cutlery, allowing them to be usable for a year, after which, they start to biodegrade without any plastic leftover.",
