    id: 21153,
    fact: 'The Netherlands is so safe, it imports criminals to fill jails. The Netherlands has enjoyed a steady drop in crime since 2004, and has become so safe that it\'s closed down one jail after another"”23 prisons shut their doors since 2014.To help mitigate the job losses that this has created, the country has taken to importing prisoners from other countries, bringing 242 inmates from Norway in 2015.',
