    id: 21161,
    fact: 'In 1984, a woman started hearing voices in her mind that later proved to save her life. The voices told her that she had a tumor and should consider taking a brain scan. She had no symptoms at all, but still, the expensive treatment was arranged. On doing the scan, the hospital staff was shocked to detect a brain tumor. The treatment was carried out immediately. According to her, she heard from the voices one last time after regaining consciousness when she heard them say, "We are pleased to have helped you. Goodbye." Some believe they were divine voices, while others say she was vaguely aware that something was wrong.',
